        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.32.11+EXO.32.12+EXO.32.13+EXO.32.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ex 32.11-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “So I lay prostrate before the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " for these forty days and forty nights, because the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had said he would destroy you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I prayed to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", ‘O Lord ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", destroy not thy people and thy heritage, whom thou hast redeemed through thy greatness, whom thou hast brought out of Egypt with a mighty hand. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Remember thy servants, Abraham, Isaac, and Jacob; do not regard the stubbornness of this people, or their wickedness, or their sin, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lest the land from which thou didst bring us say, “Because the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " was not able to bring them into the land which he promised them, and because he hated them, he has brought them out to slay them in the wilderness.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For they are thy people and thy heritage, whom thou didst bring out by thy great power and by thy outstretched arm.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
